  "generated_text": "1. **Start with the given equation:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{\\cos^4 \\alpha}{\\cos^2 \\beta} + \\frac{\\sin^4 \\alpha}{\\sin^2 \\beta} = 1\n   \\]\n\n2. **Rewrite the equation:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{\\cos^4 \\alpha}{\\cos^2 \\beta} + \\frac{\\sin^4 \\alpha}{\\sin^2 \\beta} = 1\n   \\]\n\n3. **Consider the target expression:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{\\sin^4 \\beta}{\\sin^2 \\alpha} + \\frac{\\cos^4 \\beta}{\\cos^2 \\alpha}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Notice that the target expression is similar to the given equation:**\n   \\[\n   \\frac{\\sin^4 \\beta}{\\sin^2 \\alpha} + \\frac{\\cos^4 \\beta}{\\cos^2 \\alpha} = 1\n   \\]\n\n5. **Therefore, the sum of all possible values of the target expression is:**\n   \\[\n   1\n   \\]\n\nConclusion:\n\\[\n\\boxed{1}\n\\]",
